# AUTHORS - BEX bioinformatics repository
# Repository: https://github.com/mathisnozais/BEX
# This repository provides scripts and instruction for reproducing analyses; it is associated to a zenodo repository including docker containers, intermediate files and final objects
# DOI: https://zenodo.org/record/14044880
# Original associated research article: Quessada, Nozais et al., Ectopic expression of BEX genes in T-cell Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia (2025). DOI: 10.1182/bloodadvances.2024015174. 

# Core contributors (code, pipelines, Docker)
Mathis Nozais (Aix Marseille Univ, CNRS, INSERM, CRCM, Marseille, France) 
  - Role: Lead developer
  - Contribution: Developed pipelines and analysis for scRNA-seq, RNAseq, and confocal microscopy; created Docker images for reproducible execution.

Saran Pankaew (Aix Marseille Univ, CNRS, I2M, Marseille, France)
  - Role: Developer
  - Contribution: Performed preliminary analysis of TCGA RNAseq data.

