# Notes:
#######################
# - This repository is associated with the research article from Quessada, Nozais et al. (DOI: 10.1182/bloodadvances.2024015174), but authorship here reflects contributions specifically to computational and bioinformatics resources.
# - Roles:
#    - Core contributors: main contributor to code and pipelines (Lead developer) or significant contribution to code or data processing (Developer).
#    - Contributor: input on analysis, data interpretation, or documentation (Contributor) and strategic guidance for the overall project (Project leader).
#    - Bioinformatics lead: supervision of all bioinformatics work for this repository
# - The repository includes scripts & instructions whereas Docker containers, intermediate files, and final objects to facilitate reproducible research are available on zenodo (DOI: https://zenodo.org/record/14044880).
